  pose proof (ad_ctx_nodes L ALO) as D_c_n. pose proof (ad_ctx_store L ALO) as D_c_s. pose proof (ad_ctx_fake L ALO) as D_c_f. pose proof (ad_ctx_ptr L ALO) as D_c_p.
