pose proof (KT_t L sp lo a ms _ _ _ WTF) as Kt.
  pose proof (KT_ctx L sp lo a ms _ _ _ WTF) as Kctx. pose proof (KT_res L sp lo a ms _ _ _ WTF) as Kres.
